			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://techhub.social/@jerryD\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jerryD</span></a></span> I think you might have misunderstood. Tidal and Spotify are competitors—it seems like Microsoft is selling OS-level advertising space on Tidal’s web site (basically).</p>",
